WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.922
Skrivist Books. Your library, on every device.

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:08.720
Keep your books on Armarium, the free library server you run at home.

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:13.055
Scan its QR code with Skrivist Books, and you're connected.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:18.555
Browse your catalogue, and download any book to read offline.

00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:25.195
EPUB or PDF, set just the way you like to read.

00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:32.692
Your place syncs through Armarium. Stop on your iPhone, and carry on from your iPad or Android.

00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:39.009
Skrivist Books. For iPhone, iPad and Android.
